<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Fina, daurada</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Longitud</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">~800 metres</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Amplada</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Variable, 30–50 metres</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Onatge</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Generalment suau, mar obert</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Bandera Blava</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Sí</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Accés mobilitat reduïda</strong></td>
